[{"id":178117107,"discussion_id":"b1ae7a590ce3056c8c1971f80f3c4bb838de66a8","body":"## CLA Signature Pass  \n yushan-kite, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-01T20:25:51+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T20:25:51+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178117109,"discussion_id":"599360be5534edee9136cc6c66650bfb6d0ad7b0","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*商晓波*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714), [*林鹏翔*](https://gitcode.com/LinPX) (2/2) | ✅ [*商晓波*](https://gitcode.com/sxb154714) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n yushan-kite, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-07-01T20:25:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T09:56:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178117365,"discussion_id":"238103762d024aae2f32c63e240ebb017ebeb4a2","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-07-01T20:27:29+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T20:27:29+08:00","user":{"id":"68b567da7be61e5cb7e58588","login":"yushan-kite","object_id":"68b567da7be61e5cb7e58588","name":"yushan-kite","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yushan-kite"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178117625,"discussion_id":"cae3f24290d9e5b4831a12a4f1a8ed9f5c15a5b6","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n本次变更修复了 `RotateQuant` 算子在输入为 subnormal（非规约）浮点数时存在的精度问题。主要调整了 `block_epilogue_rotate_quant.h` 中 `zeroMask` 的比较逻辑：原先基于 `vdMaxExp`（或 `vdMaxExpOnly`）与 `zeroRegTensor` 比较生成 `zeroMask`，并将 `scaleValue` 中对应位置置零，这导致 subnormal 数值被错误地当作零处理。修复后将 `zeroMask` 的比较对象改为 `sharedExp`，且移除了对 `scaleValue` 的强制置零选择操作，从而保留 subnormal 数值的正确量化结果。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`zeroMask` 比较源调整**：删除对 `vdMaxExp` / `vdMaxExpOnly` 的 `zeroMask` 比较指令（两处，分别位于 `isDynamic` 分支和 `else` 分支），改为使用 `sharedExp` 与 `zeroRegTensor` 比较，且该比较移至 `StoreAlign` 之后执行，使得后续依赖 `zeroMask` 的操作（如 `specialDataMask` 和 `halfScale` 的计算）基于正确的共享指数。\n- **移除对 `scaleValue` 的错误置零**：删除了 `Select<uint16_t>(scaleValue, scaleValue, zeroRegTensor, zeroMask)` 这条指令，不再在 `scaleValue` 写入前将其强制置零，避免 subnormal 输入的 `scaleValue` 被错误归零。\n- **比较时序调整**：`zeroMask` 的比较从 `StoreAlign` 之前移至之后，确保存储到目标地址的 `scaleValue` 不受 `zeroMask` 干扰，而 `zeroMask` 仅影响后续 `specialDataMask` 和 `halfScale` 的掩码计算。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T20:28:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T20:28:53+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url"