\n**已审查的文件：**\n- `matmul/common/cmct/epilogue/block_epilogue_rotate_quant.h` — 发现 1 个 P0 问题（拼写错误）\n\n| 类型 | 数量 |\n|------|-------|\n| \uD83D\uDD34 阻塞 | 1 |\n| \uD83D\uDFE1 建议 | 0 |\n\n⛔ 需要修改\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T20:43:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-01T20:43:23+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":178120161,"discussion_id":"ed4b693486f582678cf4d3c756dee1fb1c24594d","body":"\uD83D\uDD34 **Critical**\n\n第 593 行新增的 `Compare` 调用中使用了 `zeorRegTensor`，这是一个不存在的符号。该文件中声明的变量名为 `zeroRegTensor`（第 549 行声明，第 558 行通过 `Duplicate(zeroRegTensor, 0)` 初始化）。`zeorRegTensor` 未被声明或定义，任何包含此头文件并实例化 `ScaleVf` 模板的翻译单元将产生编译错误（未声明标识符）。该问题是本次 diff 引入的拼写错误（\"zeor\" → \"zero\" 的字母顺序颠倒）。\n\n**建议**：将 `zeorRegTensor` 修正为 `zeroRegTensor`。\n\n```suggestion\n            Compare<uint16_t, CMPMODE::NE>(zeroMask, sharedExp, zeroRegTensor, preMaskScale);\n```\n","created_at":"2026-07-01T20:43:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T09:09:59+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68b567da7be61e5cb7e58588","login":"yushan-kite","object_id":"68b567da7be61e5cb7e58588","name":"yushan-kite","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/yushan-kite"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":593,"end_new_line":593,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":178151261,"body":"changed this line on [2c88d423](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/commits/detail/2c88d423c83190c4e4ffd71ea0d9639d7a263509?ref=9.1